    (uuid "d679a6d4-6359-529f-a54a-32a878d9f6c4"))
  (text "Bootstrap: external Schottky (FD6288 has none) + 1 uF per phase. Cboot >= Qg / dV = 34 nC / 0.1 V = 0.34 uF;"
